1967.description:
Modern politics is such a complex subject that sometimes many people simply don't understand what's happening and how, why certain decisions are made, and why war is necessary. It's time to lay all the cards on the table and explain to people what drives the people who stand at the origins of such a powerful and responsible government.

You'll face a vast array of diverse issues. Initially, you'll need to choose a system, ranging from democracy to totalitarianism. You'll need to restore order in your country, position yourself appropriately on the global stage, and strive to achieve success, gradually moving toward global domination. But don't rush, as the consequences of your every action will impact not only your reputation but also the well-being of your citizens.

Therefore, to strive for success, you will need to strive to solve all pressing problems, invest in the country's development, strive to properly manage the country's resources, and be able to transcend moral and ethical boundaries. As a politician, you are not destined to doubt; only confident actions and the ability to regulate every aspect of your state will allow you to achieve success without problems. Most interestingly, modern politics will be presented based on the current situation. The collapse of the European Union is approaching, the entire world is engulfed in the cruelty and mercilessness of terrorists, and the United States is edging ever closer to World War II. How will you act, surrounded by such unpleasant circumstances? You will only be able to find out after you have the opportunity to download Realpolitiks via torrent for free.

Game features:
- first you should choose the country that you want to lead to world domination;
- choose the format and system of governance of the country;
- you will face a whole list of various problems that concern domestic and foreign policy; the problems can be both small and large-scale;
- it's time to release spies and start controlling the internal politics of other countries;
- whether to follow moral and ethical principles, or to step over them in the name of power, it is up to you to decide;
- the game offers complete freedom of action in choosing a solution.

Installation and launch:
1. Download and unzip
3. Run the realpolitiks.exe file
4. Play.
